#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not add or expand questions</b>. Instead either edit the "
"question or add a question comment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne smejo dodajati ali razširjati vprašanj</b>. Namesto tega "
"uredite vprašanje ali dodajte komentar k vprašanju."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not add or expand questions</b>. Instead, either edit the "
"question or add a comment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne smejo dodajati ali razširjati vprašanj</b>. Namesto tega "
"uredite vprašanje ali dodajte komentar."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not comment other answers</b>. Instead add a comment on "
"the other answers."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne smejo komentirati drugih odgovorov</b>. Namesto tega dodajte "
"komentar k drugim odgovorom."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not start debates</b> This community Q&amp;A is not a "
"discussion group. Please avoid holding debates in your answers as they tend "
"to dilute the essence of questions and answers. For brief discussions please "
"use commenting facility."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne smejo sprožati razprav</b> Ta skupnostna vprašanja in "
"odgovori niso skupina za razprave. Izogibajte se razpravam v svojih "
"odgovorih, saj te pogosto zameglijo bistvo vprašanj in odgovorov. Za kratke "
"razprave uporabite funkcijo komentiranja."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just point to other Questions</b>. Instead add a "
"question comment indication \"Possible duplicate of...\". However, it's ok "
"to include links to other questions or answers providing relevant additional "
"information."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne smejo biti samo napotitve na druga vprašanja</b>. Namesto "
"tega dodajte oznako komentarja vprašanja »Možna podvojitev vprašanja …«. "
"Vendar je v redu vključiti povezave do drugih vprašanj ali odgovorov, ki "
"zagotavljajo ustrezne dodatne informacije."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just point to other questions</b>.Instead add a comment "
"indicating <i>\"Possible duplicate of...\"</i>. However, it's fine to "
"include links to other questions or answers providing relevant additional "
"information."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne bi smeli zgolj napotiti na druga vprašanja</b>.Namesto tega "
"dodajte komentar z navedbo <i>\"Morda je podvojeno vprašanje ...\"</i>. "
"Vendar je povsem v redu vključiti povezave do drugih vprašanj ali odgovorov, "
"ki ponujajo ustrezne dodatne informacije."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just provide a link a solution</b>. Instead provide the "
"solution description text in your answer, even if it's just a copy/paste. "
"Links are welcome, but should be complementary to answer, referring sources "
"or additional reading."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne smejo zgolj vsebovati povezave do rešitve</b>. Namesto tega v "
"svojem odgovoru navedite opis rešitve, tudi če gre le za kopiranje in "
"lepljenje. Povezave so dobrodošle, vendar naj dopolnjujejo odgovor ter se "
"nanašajo na vire ali dodatno branje."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Before you ask - please make sure to search for a similar question.</b> "
"You can search questions by their title or tags. It’s also OK to answer your "
"own question."
msgstr ""
"<b>Preden vprašate – prosimo, prepričajte se, da ste poiskali podobno "
"vprašanje.</b> Vprašanja lahko iščete po njihovem naslovu ali oznakah. Prav "
"tako je v redu, če odgovorite na svoje vprašanje."

#. module: website_slides_forum
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Please avoid asking questions that are too subjective and argumentative</"
"b> or not relevant to this community."
msgstr ""
"<b>Prosimo, izogibajte se postavljanju vprašanj, ki so preveč subjektivna in "
"polemična</b> ali niso relevantna za to skupnost."

