#: model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, if you ask an interesting question or give a helpful answer, "
"your input will be upvoted. On the other hand if the answer is misleading - "
"it will be downvoted. Each vote in favor will generate 10 points, each vote "
"against will subtract 2 points. There is a limit of 200 points that can be "
"accumulated for a question or answer per day. The table given at the end "
"explains reputation point requirements for each type of moderation task."
msgstr ""
"Na primer, če postavite zanimivo vprašanje ali podate koristen odgovor, bo "
"vaše uporabniško ime prejelo glas za. Po drugi strani bo v primeru "
"zavajajočega odgovora prejelo glas proti. Vsak glas za prinese 10 točk, vsak "
"glas proti pa odšteje 2 točki. Za vprašanje ali odgovor je mogoče na dan "
"zbrati največ 200 točk. Tabela na koncu pojasnjuje zahteve glede števila "
"točk ugleda za posamezno vrsto moderacijske naloge."

