msgid ""
"If you fit in one of these example or if your motivation for asking the "
"question is “I would like to participate in a discussion about ______”, then "
"you should not be asking here but on our mailing lists. However, if your "
"motivation is “I would like others to explain ______ to me”, then you are "
"probably OK."
msgstr ""
"Če za vas velja eden od teh primerov ali če je vaša motivacija za "
"zastavljanje vprašanja »Rad/-a bi sodeloval/-a v razpravi o ______«, potem "
"vprašanja ne bi smeli zastaviti tukaj, temveč na naših poštnih seznamih. Če "
"pa je vaša motivacija »Rad/-a bi, da mi drugi razložijo ______«, potem ste "
"verjetno na pravem mestu."

